{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Orxta","id":"343605682580488215","is_bot":0,"username":"robdor."},"author_id":"343605682580488215","channel_id":"739240413269065890","content":"<@!292531828592738304> In addition to the 1000 gold you will need to be officially sponsored by an aristocrat 🍰. Generally, a willing aristocrat will pay your set up costs. If you can scrounge together money from another source, you still need an aristocrat patron to sponsor you, and aristocrats can only sponsor one merchant at a time. Until you get a patron you can craft 2 mundane items per day for free with no labor. Each item must be worth 50 gold or less (as stated in their source material). You can sell these mundane items as any price you like. (Since it's come up before, healing potions are considered magical items and can not be crafted using this method). Examples of mundane items are things like rope, waterskins, shields, daggers, ball bearings, and the like.","created_at":"2020-08-04T14:35:09.875000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740216263934083112","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
